[Ayushman Bharat PM-JAY | eligibility]
The scheme covers all 37 lakh ASHAs/ AWWs/AWHs working across the country and their families for free healthcare benefits.
Also, AB-PMJAY is provided as an entitlement based scheme for the poor and vulnerable families. The entitlement is decided on the basis of deprivation criteria in the SECC database.
The different categories in rural and urban areas include
families having only one room with kucha walls and kucha roof;
families having no adult member between age 16 to 59;
female headed households with no adult male member between age 16 to 59;
disabled member and no able bodied adult member in the family;
SC/ST households;

